    <item>
      <title>埃德·马基 (Ed Markey) 击败年轻的挑战者，赢得马萨诸塞州民主党参议院初选</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/01/us/politics/massachusetts-senate-democratic-primary.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[马萨诸塞州历史上最年长的参议员用进步的信息击败了 47 岁的众议员塞思·莫尔顿，无视代际变革的呼吁。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/01/us/politics/massachusetts-senate-democratic-primary.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 02:52:03 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>前拜登白宫助手赢得马萨诸塞州民主党众议院初选</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/01/us/politics/massachusetts-democratic-primary-6th-district.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[丹·科（Dan Koh）在前总统小约瑟夫·R·拜登的支持下参选，在激烈的竞争中脱颖而出，获得了安全的民主党第六国会选区的提名。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/01/us/politics/massachusetts-democratic-primary-6th-district.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 02:31:16 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>“别担心我”：袭击者的父亲认为她已经度过了难关</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/01/nyregion/times-square-stabbing-suspect.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[帕梅拉·西斯内罗斯在时代广场刺伤两人，其中一人死亡，被警方击毙。她的父亲说她已经不再和他一起去参加心理健康检查了。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/01/nyregion/times-square-stabbing-suspect.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 02:02:57 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>普京承诺加强对乌克兰的打击并支持伊朗</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/01/world/europe/putin-ukraine-iran.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[俄罗斯总统承诺继续对乌克兰人进行报复，并“全力声援”伊朗。]]></description>
