    <item>
      <title>专家称时代广场警察开枪是合理的，但将其他人置于危险之中</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/01/nyregion/times-square-shooting-stabbing-nypd.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[专家表示，警察站在一名挥舞着两把菜刀的妇女周围，然后在没有清理该地区的情况下开枪，有伤害自己或路人的风险。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/01/nyregion/times-square-shooting-stabbing-nypd.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 01:37:45 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>时代广场刺伤事件中被杀的女子被确认为美国银行副总裁</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/01/nyregion/victims-stabbing-times-square-nyc.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[纽约警察局公布了一些参与在拥挤的曼哈顿街道上看似随机的持刀袭击事件的人的姓名，但问题仍然存在。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/01/nyregion/victims-stabbing-times-square-nyc.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:25:16 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普称美国因霍尔木兹海峡地雷袭击伊朗</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/01/us/politics/us-launches-air-strikes-iran.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[伊朗官员表示，袭击造成严重破坏，包括在一场婚礼上造成四人死亡、数十人受伤。伊朗表示，它向美国在该地区的基地开火进行报复。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/01/us/politics/us-launches-air-strikes-iran.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:23:07 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>众议院谴责共和党被指控性骚扰两名助手</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/01/us/politics/house-censure-chuck-edwards.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[众议员查克·爱德华兹 (Chuck Edwards) 在演讲后受到了正式谴责，他在演讲中为自己的行为道歉，但表示这并不构成骚扰。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/01/us/politics/house-censure-chuck-edwards.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 22:22:45 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
